{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-06-08 16:35:00', 'title': 'COLGATE DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF COLGATE-PALMOLIVE COMPANY (NYSE:CL) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON AUGUST 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JULY 21, 2023. THE COMPANY HAS PAID UNINTERRUPTED DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON STOCK SINCE 1895. * * * COLGATE-PALMOLIVE COMPANY IS A CARING, INNOVATIVE GROWTH COMPANY THAT IS REIMAGINING A HEALTHIER FUTURE FOR ALL PEOPLE, THEIR PETS AND OUR PLANET. FOCUSED ON ORAL CARE, PERSONAL CARE, HOM.'}